      "startedAt": "2026-11-05T13:29:56.223Z",
      "report": {
        "outcome": "Rechecked both libraries as current tagged releases with active upstreams and no supersession notice, added license notices and the runtime dependencies, integrated `internal/htmlread`, and wired bounded `http(s)://` providers into the read router. HTML defaults to readable Markdown, `:raw` keeps the document, redirects/charsets/cycles/credentials/binary media are enforced, and a live agent read test passes.",
        "decisions": [
          "Keep the static provider independent of fetch-backend registration — backend dispatch belongs to Phase D/C and must not be advertised before it exists.",
