        }
      ],
      "report": {
        "outcome": "Bounded output is covered by the LogStore paging/eviction/rotation tests, descendant cancellation by the process-group kill and escalation tests, crash reclamation by the registry tests plus the live SIGKILL run, and shared policy now by TestLiveConfiguredJobTimeoutApplies (config jobs.timeout-seconds = 1 ends a sleep 30 with timedOut).",
